# Copy to .dev.vars (gitignored) for local dev.
# Required — enables chat + benchmark runs (they call the Anthropic API):
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
# Optional — when set, /api/* requires this value in the x-usai-key header.
# Strongly recommended in production: chat and runs spend your tokens.
# ACCESS_TOKEN=choose-a-shared-secret
# Optional providers — each key unlocks that AI as a chat DRIVER and as a
# benchmark SUBJECT (directive §3 frontier tier / §7 driver logging):
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# GEMINI_API_KEY=...
# RUNPOD_API_KEY=...       # open-weight pod provisioning (vLLM)
# HF_TOKEN=hf_...          # gated HF repos (Llama) on pods
